This adds project settings for generating bindings/intellisense data for generated/preprocessed code that may exist in ones project. Thus making it much easier to add custom pre-processors to a project generally. I tried to target the most common use cases here to start with, so it supports generating both `static`/`member` methods. You can additionally specify "accessor"-like methods, that may be automatically declared for members of a given class.

Users can now do things such as add a custom `UActorComponent::GetChecked` to their project, or automatically bind accessors for the underlying `FGameplayAttribute` for a given `FGameplayAttributeData` property on `UAttributeSet` - all without needing to fork the language server/vscode plugin. 🎉 

Here's an example configuration:
```json
"UnrealAngelscript.projectCodeGeneration.enable": true,
"UnrealAngelscript.projectCodeGeneration.generators": [
    {
        "derivedFrom": "UAttributeSet",
        "staticFunctions": [
            {
                "returnType": "const {class}&",
                "name": "MyStaticFunc",
                "args": [
                    {
                        "type": "const FQuat&",
                        "name": "Test"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "memberFunctions": [
            {
                "returnType": "UObject",
                "name": "MyMemberFunc",
                "const": true,
                "args": [
                    {
                        "type": "UObject",
                        "name": "Test"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "staticAccessors": [
            {
                "derivedFrom": "FGameplayAttributeData",
                "returnType": "const {propType}&",
                "name": "MyStaticFunc{propName}",
                "args": [
                    {
                        "type": "const FQuat&",
                        "name": "Test"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ],
        "memberAccessors": [
            {
                "returnType": "UObject",
                "name": "MyMemberFunc{propName}",
                "args": [
                    {
                        "type": "UObject",
                        "name": "Test"
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
],
```

